      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "All the assets follow a certain naming convention:\n_O_          OneSided
        assets\n_M_          PivotMiddle assets\n_E_          PivotEdge assets\nlarge       
        6 units \nmed          4 units\nsmall         2 units\n\nSome PARTS and Level
        Modules additionaly have directions added based on compass directions:\nS              
        Path leads to the South\nSE             Path leads to the South and the East\nNS            
        Path leads to the South and the North\nSEW          Path leads to the South,
        East and the West\netc."
